<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Coluseo Heal</Major>
    <Description>Coluseo Heal, also means Heal for all party members.

This is a spam heal macro, in case of any emergency or danger situation.

Just press that 1 button and your Bishop will instantly switch into a healing machine, ensure all party members survive the sudden attack.

___________________________________________________

Heal can go up to 12 members which is limit for the party system.
Heal do not affect or get lesser for the number of members shared.

___________________________________________________

Do not need to re-click to follow the character again, just press the other usual macro key once the danger is past.

This make the game play training multiple characters together easier to manage, without need to switch the window often. 

___________________________________________________

Thank you for Keyran.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
